      "text": "A benchmark harness runs 33 fixtures against KlaatCode, Claude Code, opencode, Cursor, and Grok Build; the reported latest run (2026-07-20) shows 33/33 solved at $0.027 per solved task and 51.7K tokens per task, with reproduction instructions via bun run bench."
    },
