  "summary": "Selected evidence records: The CLI can run as an HTTP server (`klaatcode serve --port 4200`) exposing /v1/health, /v1/info, /v1/chat and /v1/run with SSE streaming, and `klaatcode web` serves a browser UI on the same server. The client is described as a thin terminal to the hosted Klaatu service, which performs routing, model health tracking, pricing, and code-graph indexing server-side.",
  "superseded_claim_ids": []
